e.', 'similarity score': 0.6949576735496521}, {'clip_101_103': 'clip_101_103', 'text': '**Frame 101s:** A split-screen shows a cooking demonstration. On the left, a metal bowl contains ground meat and minced garlic as someone pours dark soy sauce from a bottle. On the right, a woman with black hair tied back (wearing a white shirt and light green apron) stands in a modern kitchen pouring the sauce. An inset box shows another woman with reddish hair watching. Korean text reads "계란 없이 장으로 투투투" (pouring soy sauce without eggs).\n\n**Frame 102s:** A wide shot reveals the full kitchen setting—stainless steel refrigerator, wooden cabinets, and white countertops. The same woman stands at the kitchen island preparing ingredients, with the soy sauce bottle now placed on the counter beside her.\n\n**Frame 103s:** A closer view shows the woman actively mixing the meat and seasonings together in the bowl using her hands. The on-screen text "섞어" (mix) appears twice beside her hands as she works the ingredients.\n\n**Setting & Mood:** The sequence takes place in a clean, modern home kitchen. The atmosphere is calm and instructional, typical of a cooking tutorial or food variety show (indicated by the program title "편스토랑" visible in the corner). The focus is on hands-on food preparation with an emphasis on technique.', 'similarity score': 0.6944349408149719}, {'clip_307_315': 'clip_307_315', 'text': 'In this sequence from a Korean cooking show ("**편스토랑**"), a woman in a white shirt and sage green apron demonstrates skilled dumpling-making in a bright, plant-filled studio kitchen.\n\n**Actions:** The woman rapidly assembles dumplings with practiced efficiency. She places filling onto a wrapper (wearing a white finger cot), folds it in half, and seals the edges with precise pinching motions. Her hands move fluidly without hesitation, completing the dumpling in seconds.\n\n**Visual Details:** The sequence focuses heavily on close-ups of her hands working over a white tray with a flor