e.\n- **Korean text** overlays read: "13년차 장녀 보라" (13th-year eldest daughter Bora) and "대식구 맞춤 만두 만두 100개 시작" (Starting 100 dumplings for a large family).\n\n**Setting & Mood:** The scene takes place in a clean, contemporary home kitchen. The mood is **busy and purposeful**, capturing the preparation phase of a large-scale cooking task for a family meal.', 'similarity score': 0.6799516081809998}, {'clip_435_439': 'clip_435_439', 'text': 'In this sequence, a woman in a white shirt and light green apron is preparing food in a modern Korean home setting. \n\n**Frame 435s** shows a close-up of her hands working with a small piece of white dough or filling, with houseplants visible in the bright background. The show title "편스토랑" appears in the top-left corner alongside text mentioning "500원."\n\n**Frames 436-437s** switch to a wide shot revealing her sitting on the floor at a low white table equipped with a large metal mixing bowl, smaller bowls, and cooking utensils. The room features wooden flooring, a dark accent wall with an intercom, and potted plants.\n\n**Frames 438-439s** continue the wide shot as she manipulates the food with her hands, while Korean text appears on the right: *"엄마랑 통화하니까 옛날 생각난다"* ("Talking with mom reminds me of old times"). \n\nThe scene conveys a calm, nostalgic domestic mood, emphasizing traditional home cooking in a contemporary setting.', 'similarity score': 0.666751503944397}, {'clip_449_451': 'clip_449_451', 'text': '**Frame 1 (449s):** A wide-angle shot shows a woman sitting on the floor of a modern apartment living room, working at a low white table. She appears to be preparing dumplings (mandu) while talking on the phone. The room features wooden flooring, an entrance area with doors, an air conditioner, and decorative plants. Korean text overlays indicate this is from the cooking show "편스토랑" (Pyeon Restaurant), with captions reading "Completed the second batch while on the phone" and mentioning a challenge to make 100 dumplings.\n\n*