Caption search results: [{'clip_243_248': 'clip_243_248', 'text': 'In this cooking demonstration sequence from the Korean show *Pyeonstaurant* (편스토랑), a woman in a white shirt and light green apron strains liquid from a white cloth bag (likely containing a blended or soaked ingredient) into a clear glass bowl. \n\n**Actions:** The woman firmly twists and squeezes the cloth bag with both hands, extracting a thick white liquid that streams into the bowl below. The on-screen text "콸콸" (an onomatopoeia for pouring liquid) appears during the squeezing action.\n\n**Visual Details:** The close-up shots focus on her hands—one wearing a smartwatch with a black band—working the bag over a kitchen counter with metal bowls visible in the background. \n\n**Setting:** The scene takes place in a bright kitchen studio environment.\n\n**Additional Elements:** Small picture-in-picture boxes in the bottom right corner show commentators reacting: first a man in a dark blue outfit, then switching to a man in a red outfit who gestures as he speaks.\n\n**Mood:** The atmosphere is calm and instructional, with the woman smiling gently at the beginning, suggesting a lighthearted cooking competition atmosphere.', 'similarity score': 0.7248544692993164}, {'clip_163_167': 'clip_163_167', 'text': 'In this kitchen scene, a woman wearing a light green apron and a smartwatch prepares ingredients by dehydrating them using a manual method. \n\n**163s–164s:** Close-up shots show her hands wrapping ingredients (likely bean sprouts, per the on-screen Korean text *"대체 숙주도 면포에 올려주고"*) in a white cotton cloth over a glass bowl. A large metal bowl filled with chopped green vegetables sits nearby on the counter.\n\n**165s–167s:** The camera pulls back to reveal the woman twisting and squeezing the cloth bundle with both hands to extract liquid, acting as a manual press. She wrings it tightly over the bowl, demonstrating significant effort. \n\n**Setting & Text:** The modern kitchen features a washing machine, gas stove, and wooden cutting board. Korean text overlays include *"인간 탈수기"* (Human dehydrator) humorously describing her action, and *"타지 등장"* (Dashi appears/enters), suggesting she\'s preparing stock. The mood is focused and domestic, typical of a cooking demonstration.', 'similarity score': 0.7209933400154114}, {'clip_137_141': 'clip_137_141', 'text': 'In this sequence from a Korean cooking show (**"편스토랑"** visible in the top-left corner), a woman wearing a white polo shirt and light green apron stands at a kitchen sink, vigorously squeezing a white, cloth-wrapped ingredient (likely tofu or bean curd) with both hands to extract moisture. \n\n**Frame progression**: She begins by pressing the ingredient over the sink (137s), then continues with visible effort, her face showing a strained but determined smile as she wrings it tightly (138-140s). Throughout the sequence, a small inset in the bottom-right corner shows a male host/commentator watching with an amused, grinning expression. \n\n**Setting details**: The modern kitchen features a stainless steel refrigerator, countertop with cooking utensils, and a large bowl of chopped greens (likely scallions) waiting beside her. On-screen text displays ingredient names and prices (100g). The mood is lighthearted and comedic, emphasizing the physical effort required for the cooking preparation.', 'similarity score': 0.7113756537437439}, {'clip_92_96': 'clip_92_96', 'text': 'In this cooking demonstration sequence from the Korean show **"편스토랑" (Pyeonstaurant)**, a woman in a white polo shirt and mint green apron prepares a marinade in a modern kitchen studio.\n\n**Actions:** The woman carefully pours **맛간장** (tasty soy sauce) from a large bottle with a red cap into a stainless steel mixing bowl containing ground meat topped with minced garlic and ginger. The camera transitions from a medium shot of her concentrating face to close-ups of her hands steadily streaming the dark liquid over the ingredients.\n\n**Setting & Objects:** The scene takes place in a clean, organized kitchen with wooden cabinets, stainless steel appliances, and a colorful fruit poster on the wall. Visible items include a mixing spoon, a knife on the counter, and seasoning containers with yellow and white lids beside the bowl. The woman wears a smartwatch on her left wrist.\n\n**Text:** On-screen graphics display the show title "편스토랑," menu text referencing "1인용 된장 보쌈과" (single serving soybean paste bossam), and the prominent yellow text "맛간장" identifying the ingredient being added.\n\n**Mood:** The atmosphere is calm, methodical, and professional—typical of an instructional cooking segment—with the woman\'s focused expression emphasizing careful seasoning and preparation technique.', 'similarity score': 0.6982998847961426}, {'clip_133_137': 'clip_133_137', 'text': 'In this kitchen cooking segment, a woman demonstrates how to remove excess moisture from tofu. \n\n**Actions:** The sequence begins with a close-up of hands holding tofu wrapped in a white cloth (133s). The woman then stands at a kitchen sink, vigorously squeezing and twisting the cloth bundle with both hands to extract liquid (134s-136s). By 137s, she continues squeezing with focused effort while a small inset shows a male commentator laughing heartily at the scene.\n\n**People/Objects:** The main subject is a woman with dark hair tied back, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a sage green apron, plus a smartwatch. She handles a white cloth pouch containing tofu over a stainless steel sink. A large metal bowl filled with chopped green vegetables sits on the counter beside her.\n\n**Setting:** A modern domestic kitchen featuring white countertops, dark cabinetry, a stainless steel refrigerator, and various cooking ingredients and tools arranged on the counter.\n\n**Visible Text:** Korean text appears throughout: in the top-left corner reads "편스토랑" (show title), while the top banner displays "13번째 참가자" (13th participant) and "황금 레시피 만능 100배." The first frame includes instructional text: "수분이 많은 두부는 면포에 싸서 물기를 제거" (Tofu with lots of moisture—wrap in cloth to remove water).\n\n**Mood:** Practical and instructional, shifting to lighthearted in the final frame due to the laughing reaction shot.', 'similarity score': 0.698062002658844}, {'clip_307_315': 'clip_307_315', 'text': 'In this sequence from a Korean cooking show ("**편스토랑**"), a woman in a white shirt and sage green apron demonstrates skilled dumpling-making in a bright, plant-filled studio kitchen.\n\n**Actions:** The woman rapidly assembles dumplings with practiced efficiency. She places filling onto a wrapper (wearing a white finger cot), folds it in half, and seals the edges with precise pinching motions. Her hands move fluidly without hesitation, completing the dumpling in seconds.\n\n**Visual Details:** The sequence focuses heavily on close-ups of her hands working over a white tray with a floral design. A large metal bowl of filling sits to the left. On-screen text includes "**감으로 만두소 넣고**" (Adding filling by feel) and sound effects "**꾸욱**" (squeezing sounds). The final frame displays "**거침없는 손놀림**" (Unhesitating/flawless hand movements) alongside reaction inset shots of a smiling woman and a surprised man.\n\n**Mood:** Professional and impressively efficient, highlighting the woman\'s expertise and speed, likely for a challenge involving making 100 dumplings (referenced in the top text: "**만두 100개 챙기**").', 'similarity score': 0.6971313953399658}, {'clip_432_435': 'clip_432_435', 'text': 'In this sequence, a woman wearing a white collared shirt and a pale green apron is seated on the floor at a low white table, engaged in food preparation (likely shaping dumplings or similar items). \n\n**Frame 432s** shows a wider shot of the scene: she sits on a cushion in a bright, minimalist room with wooden floors and potted plants, working at a table holding a metal mixing bowl and small plates. Pink Korean text appears on screen: *"알겠습니다 배달 가겠습니다"* ("I understand, I\'ll go deliver it"). The top left corner displays the show title *"편스토랑"* (Pyeon Restaurant) along with text about making "보리밥라면" (barley rice ramen) for 500 won.\n\n**Frames 433s–435s** shift to a close-up of her upper body as she carefully handles a small piece of dough or filling in her hands. She looks down intently at her work, her expression focused and gentle. The background features houseplants, including one with dark purple leaves in a terracotta pot and white flowers in a vase, creating a calm, domestic atmosphere. The sequence captures the methodical, peaceful nature of home cooking.', 'similarity score': 0.6963693499565125}, {'clip_435_439': 'clip_435_439', 'text': 'In this sequence, a woman in a white shirt and light green apron is preparing food in a modern Korean home setting. \n\n**Frame 435s** shows a close-up of her hands working with a small piece of white dough or filling, with houseplants visible in the bright background. The show title "편스토랑" appears in the top-left corner alongside text mentioning "500원."\n\n**Frames 436-437s** switch to a wide shot revealing her sitting on the floor at a low white table equipped with a large metal mixing bowl, smaller bowls, and cooking utensils. The room features wooden flooring, a dark accent wall with an intercom, and potted plants.\n\n**Frames 438-439s** continue the wide shot as she manipulates the food with her hands, while Korean text appears on the right: *"엄마랑 통화하니까 옛날 생각난다"* ("Talking with mom reminds me of old times"). \n\nThe scene conveys a calm, nostalgic domestic mood, emphasizing traditional home cooking in a contemporary setting.', 'similarity score': 0.6962589025497437}, {'clip_238_243': 'clip_238_243', 'text': 'In this sequence from the Korean cooking show **"Pyeonstorang"** (편스토랑), a woman in a white collared shirt and light sage apron demonstrates how to squeeze moisture from dumpling filling.\n\n**The Action:** The sequence begins with a close-up (238s) showing hands gathering